  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nWhen navigating to /manage/about, the page fails to load entirely and shows \n\"This page couldn't load - A server error occurred\" with digest 3227098399.\n\nThe error in the logs is:\n\u2a2f [TypeError: fetch failed] {\n  digest: '3227098399',\n  [cause]: AggregateError: { code: 'ECONNREFUSED' }\n}\n\nExpected behavior: the page should load normally.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Log in to Homarr\n2. Navigate to /manage/about\n3. Page fails to load with the error above\n\n<img width=\"420\" height=\"612\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0435609e-c373-4626-843e-0ab1251c49fd\" />\n\n### Impact\n\nThe /manage/about page is completely unusable. No workaround found.\n\n### Additional information\n\nThe error digest 3227098399 matches exactly what appears in the browser.\n\n### Version\n\n1.66.1\n\n### Installation method\n\nDocker Compose\n\n### Browser\n\nFirefox",
